{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美股三大指數均上升，道瓊斯工業平均指數曾升約200點，其後升幅略為收窄。</p><p></p><p>納斯達克指數反彈，曾升約180點，升至26,600點水平。</p><p></p><p>SpaceX與特斯拉商討合併的可能性，兩者股價造好。SpaceX早段升約一成，特斯拉升近百分之4。</p><p></p><p>戴爾電腦曾經突破500美元大關，升幅約百分之8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:41:56.919476+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:49.599331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:38:32.597780+00:00","content_hash":"1d19d167000430510b0dba8ce4e4f2dbce4146bf5e4a5e1983d615d2f546bfc3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}